---
---
<section id="caracteristicas" class="py-24 border-t border-zinc-900 bg-zinc-950/20 relative">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-grid-pattern opacity-10 -z-10"></div>
  
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
        Características de Nivel Profesional
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-zinc-400">
        Diseñado para desarrolladores, escritores y cualquier persona que necesite comparar textos con rapidez y precisión.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-5xl sm:mt-20 lg:mt-24">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <!-- Feature 1: Privacy -->
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-zinc-900 bg-zinc-950/50 p-8 hover:border-zinc-800 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.01] hover:bg-zinc-950/80 group">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 group-hover:bg-indigo-500 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Privacidad Absoluta</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
            El procesamiento es 100% local. Tus archivos no viajan a ningún servidor externo. Tus datos permanecen en tu ordenador.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 2: Myers Diff -->
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-zinc-900 bg-zinc-950/50 p-8 hover:border-zinc-800 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.01] hover:bg-zinc-950/80 group">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-violet-500/10 text-violet-400 group-hover:bg-violet-500 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Algoritmo Myers</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
            Utiliza la misma lógica robusta y optimizada que Git para encontrar e insertar diferencias con el menor número de cambios posibles.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 3: Side-by-Side & Unified -->
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-zinc-900 bg-zinc-950/50 p-8 hover:border-zinc-800 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.01] hover:bg-zinc-950/80 group">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-fuchsia-500/10 text-fuchsia-400 group-hover:bg-fuchsia-500 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Vistas Flexibles</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
            Elige entre visualización en paralelo (Split) para comparar línea a línea, o unificada (Unified) para ver cambios correlativos.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 4: Drag and Drop -->
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-zinc-900 bg-zinc-950/50 p-8 hover:border-zinc-800 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.01] hover:bg-zinc-950/80 group">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 group-hover:bg-emerald-500 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7 16a4 4 0 01-.88-7.903A5 5 0 1115.9 6L16 6a5 5 0 011 9.9M15 13l-3-3m0 0l-3 3m3-3v12" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Arrastra y Suelta</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
            Sube archivos directamente arrastrándolos al panel correspondiente. Acepta formatos de código, markdown, JSON y texto plano.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 5: Word Level Highlighting -->
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-zinc-900 bg-zinc-950/50 p-8 hover:border-zinc-800 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.01] hover:bg-zinc-950/80 group">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-pink-500/10 text-pink-400 group-hover:bg-pink-500 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Diferencia de Palabras</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
            No solo resalta qué líneas cambiaron, sino también los caracteres o palabras exactas que fueron modificadas dentro de la línea.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 6: Sync Scroll -->
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-zinc-900 bg-zinc-950/50 p-8 hover:border-zinc-800 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.01] hover:bg-zinc-950/80 group">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 group-hover:bg-amber-500 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 9l4-4 4 4m0 6l-4 4-4-4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-white font-sans">Scroll Sincronizado</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
            Al desplazarte vertical u horizontalmente por una de las mitades, el lado opuesto se desliza en paralelo para mantener las líneas siempre en la misma posición.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Additional Privacy Section -->
<section id="privacidad" class="py-16 bg-zinc-950/40 border-t border-zinc-900/60">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
    <div class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 mb-4">
      <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Privacidad y Seguridad Garantizadas</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Nuestra aplicación está construida con tecnología local de navegador. Ninguno de tus textos o archivos se sube a Internet. Las comparaciones ocurren instantáneamente en tu memoria RAM.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
